WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.959
The Page, Knight, Queen and King of Cups bring the
sensitivity of water to a tarot spread.

00:00:06.959 --> 00:00:12.079
Court cards can be people, parts of yourself
or ways of approaching a situation.

00:00:13.379 --> 00:00:14.252
Page of Cups.

00:00:14.252 --> 00:00:17.005
Curiosity, tenderness, creative messages.

00:00:17.005 --> 00:00:22.040
The Page stands by the sea holding a cup
from which a small fish peeks out.

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:24.257
Knight of Cups.

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:26.764
Romance, invitation, following the heart.

00:00:26.764 --> 00:00:29.760
The Knight rides a calm horse, holding out
a cup.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:34.346
Unlike the Knight of Wands, this rider
moves steadily rather than at speed.

00:00:35.746 --> 00:00:38.246
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:43.316
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
